        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s07_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_guarantees_one_hundred_percent_accur",
          "text": "It guarantees one hundred percent accuracy on states where the expert knows the single best action, in every data and optimality setting, whereas maximum likelihood ranges from sixty seven to ninety two percent.",
