          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c4_strikingly_even_though_constraints_s",
          "text": "Strikingly, even though the constraints say nothing explicit about which action to pick in uncertain states, our method is still more accurate there than the baselines, which means the constraints implicitly transfer the expert's uncertainty structure.",
