          "anchor_id": "cue_s10_c1_clipping_bayesian_posterior_over_tra",
          "text": "By clipping a Bayesian posterior over the transition dynamics with constraints derived from a near optimal expert, you obtain gradient free offline policies that are provably safe, can outperform the expert who generated the data, and carry dramatically lower variance than maximum likelihood.",
